<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35736" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνισχύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>strengthen, confirm,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ χρόνος ταῦτα -ύσει πάντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Lex</u>
					3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγγελος ἐνισχύων αὐτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
					22.43
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Gal.Fr.</u>
				7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>prevail in</i> or <i>among,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ταῖς πόλεσι ἐνισχύει τὰ νόμιμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1180b4
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>PA</u>
				653a31
			</span></i> al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦτ᾽ ἐνισχύειν ἑκάστῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>Sens.</u>
					63
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				67
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρά τισιν ἐ. ἐν παροιμίας μέρει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					20.58
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνίσχυσεν ὡς . .</span>
			<i>the opinion prevailed</i> that . ., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				5.57
			</span></i>.</div>
